\title{The regular 9-gon}
\taxon{Remark}
\date{2026-11-24}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{This shows that a regular #{9}-gon cannot be constructed by ruler and compass.}

\p{Later we will prove the result of Gauss which says that a regular #{n}-gon is constructible if and only if #{\phi(n)} is a power of #{2}.}
